  "solution": {
    "text": "Electron withdrawing group $\\left(-\\mathrm{NO}_{2}\\right)$ increases the acidity while electron releasing group $\\left(-\\mathrm{CH}_{3},-\\mathrm{H}\\right)$ decreases acidity. Also effect will be more if functional group is present at para position than ortho and meta position."
